          "thread": "Dimon contradiction: critic vs builder",
          "why": "The spectacle of a CEO calling Bitcoin 'like smoking' while his bank processes $1B daily in blockchain payments and accepts BTC/ETH as collateral creates irresistible cognitive dissonance for readers."
